        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOQr9O0c7_rigQ",
          "commit": {
            "abbreviatedOid": "00c3189"
          },
          "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
          "authorAssociation": "NONE",
          "state": "COMMENTED",
          "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR corrects typos and improves phrasing in the IP geolocation workshop report draft.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Fixes spelling errors and capitalization of Internet-related terminology.\n- Improves sentence clarity and grammar across several report sections.\n- Normalizes citation placement and some terminology.\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/intarchboard/draft-iab-ip-geo-workshop-report/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:52Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:53Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 229,
              "body": "The updated sentence still has a comma separating the compound subject from its verb: \u201cThe technical community and the various stakeholders in the ecosystem, play\u2026\u201d. Remove this comma so the subject flows directly into \u201cplay\u201d.\n",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:52Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:53Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 69,
              "body": "\u201cMapping from IP address to the location\u201d is grammatically unclear because \u201cthe location\u201d has no specific antecedent here. Consider using \u201ca location\u201d or restoring the more general \u201clocation\u201d phrasing.\n",
              "createdAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:53Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-05-14T11:42:53Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
